              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tammy Lynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My 16 mo old slurped this up, so it gets points for baby friendly! However, I used regular blueberry yogurt instead of plain Greek. I thought it still needed a sweetener, but DD didn't seem to mind. I really don't think I'd like this with plain yogurt. Also, I like the ideas of using juice instead of water, or I even thought about using ice instead. I really like the idea of using blueberries and avocado, and I'll do that again.",
            "datePublished": "2014-03-20T15:11:55.110Z"
